      <title>氢能重卡首入商用：万亿物流新变局，Loblaw与FortisBC能否引爆绿色投资潮？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251110-%E6%B0%A2%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8D%E5%8D%A1%E9%A6%96%E5%85%A5%E5%95%86%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BF%E7%89%A9%E6%B5%81%E6%96%B0%E5%8F%98%E5%B1%80loblaw%E4%B8%8Efortisbc%E8%83%BD%E5%90%A6%E5%BC%95%E7%88%86%E7%BB%BF%E8%89%B2%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E6%BD%AE/</link>
